translate zh qst_BiteBark_6_McRoomResolution_menu_38d27225:

    # ELENA @ grumpy "The girl I was meant to protect... The one that wretched Beastmaster told you had vanished."
    ELENA @ grumpy "我应该保护的那个女孩...就是那个可恶的驯兽师告诉你已经消失的女孩。"

